-- the PvP border sits) keep the baseline.
-- Pipeline (like the meadow): woods_terrain -> woods_dress -> decor_collision -> ground settle.
-- MODE: "apply" (default) = sculpt from the stored baseline (the first run stores the current flat woods as baseline);
--       "plan" = compute only, return the numbers; "restore" = write the baseline back, remove the waterfall, unhide;
--       "rebase" = store the CURRENT terrain as the new baseline (only on flat woods), then apply.
-- Idempotent and deterministic (math.noise only). ServerStorage.WoodsTerrainStore keeps the baseline (run-length text),
-- the spots for the props tool (attributes FallsLip, FallsPool, CreekLine, ...) and hides the old straight trail road
-- part (Decor.Roads.RoadWoodsTrail -> ServerStorage.WoodsTerrainHidden; restore puts it back).
